    <string name="ui_permission_notifications_title">Why allow notifications?</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_notifications_message">Zmanio needs notifications to show the reminders you create at the right time. On the next screen, the watch will ask you to allow notifications.</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_location_title">Why allow location?</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_location_message">Your location is used to calculate accurate daily and halachic times for your area. Zmanio does not share it. On the next screen, the watch will request location access.</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_activity_title">Why allow activity recognition?</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_activity_message">Zmanio uses this permission to detect when you are asleep. It can then avoid alerting during sleep, wait, and show the reminder after you wake up. It is not used for step counting or workout tracking. On the next screen, the watch will request activity-recognition access.</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_sensors_title">Why detect the watch state?</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_sensors_message">To avoid waking you during sleep or alerting while the watch is off your wrist, Zmanio uses sensors to detect the current state. It can then alert you at the right time, or wait until you are awake and wearing the watch again. On the next screen, the watch will request sensor access.</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_full_screen_title">Why allow full-screen alerts?</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_full_screen_message">This allows an important reminder to appear over the current screen even while the watch is locked. On the next screen, enable it for Zmanio.</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_dnd_title">Allow Smart Alarm to bypass Do Not Disturb?</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_dnd_message">This optional access lets the Smart Alarm channel request sound and vibration during Do Not Disturb. On the next screen, select Zmanio and approve it. Bedtime and system settings can still block the alert.</string>
    <string name="ui_permission_dnd_unavailable">This watch does not provide the Do Not Disturb access screen.</string>
    <string name="ui_enable_alarms_reminders_title">Allow Alarms &amp; reminders</string>
    <string name="ui_enable_alarms_reminders_message">To make reminders ring on time even when the watch is saving power or the screen is off, allow Alarms &amp; reminders for this app. On the screen that opens, find Zmanio or Alarms &amp; reminders, open Zmanio, and turn on Allow.</string>
    <string name="ui_enable_alarms_reminders_hint">On the screen that opens, enable Alarms &amp; reminders so reminders can run on time.</string>
